{# The Message box above a sell-side document's Activity Log — a comment, who it is for, and
   whether to e-mail it to the customer.

   The order's and the quote's copies were byte-identical eighteen lines, differing only in the
   endpoint the Send button posts to. The invoice has none, deliberately: its timeline is written
   by its own transitions and there is no admin_invoice_log_add route, so there is no third
   caller to serve.

   NOT folded into `sales_detail_activity_log.html.twig`, though the two are adjacent on the
   quote. On the ORDER they are not adjacent — the Invoices table sits between them — so merging
   the two would move this box down the order's page, which is a layout change dressed up as a
   refactor. Two partials, each included where its section already is.

   The ids are document-neutral (`log-message`, `log-type`, `log-notify`) because app.js binds
   them page-wide and both screens already drove the same handler through the same names, which
   is the reason one partial can serve both. Renaming them breaks Send Message on BOTH screens
   silently: the markup still renders, the button just stops posting.

   Parameters
   ----------
   addUrl  required  where the Send Message button posts — the document's own log-add endpoint. #}

<section class="table-card no-search no-paginate detail-page-card" style="margin-top:30px; padding:20px;">
    <div class="table-header" style="border-bottom:none; padding-bottom:10px; margin-bottom:20px;">
        <h2 style="font-size:0.95rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b;">Message</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 220px auto; gap:16px; align-items:flex-end;">
        <textarea id="log-message" class="form-control" style="min-height:45px; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; padding:10px 12px; font-size:0.875rem; background:#f8fafc;" placeholder="Type your message here…"></textarea>
        <div class="form-group" style="margin:0;">
            <select id="log-type" class="form-control" style="height:45px; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; font-size:0.875rem; width:100%;">
                <option value="For Internal" selected>For Internal</option>
                <option value="For Client">For Client</option>
            </select>
            <label id="log-notify-container" style="display:none; align-items:center; gap:8px; font-size:0.75rem; margin-top:8px; cursor:pointer; color:#64748b; font-weight:500;">
                <input type="checkbox" id="log-notify" style="width:15px; height:15px; margin:0;">
                Send e-mail notification to client
            </label>
        </div>
        <button class="button primary js-add-log" data-url="{{ addUrl }}">Send Message</button>
    </div>
</section>
